{"page":243,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:64","surah":12,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ هَلْ ءَامَنُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ إِلَّا كَمَآ أَمِنتُكُمْ عَلَىٰٓ أَخِيهِ مِن قَبْلُ ۖ فَٱللَّهُ خَيْرٌ حَـٰفِظًا ۖ وَهُوَ أَرْحَمُ ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘Am I to entrust him to you as I did his brother before? God is the best guardian and the Most Merciful of the merciful.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Should","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُكُمْ","en_gloss":"I entrust you","transliteration":"āmanukum","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمِنتُكُمْ","en_gloss":"I entrusted you","transliteration":"amintukum","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَخِيهِ","en_gloss":"his brother","transliteration":"akhīhi","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلُ ۖ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah","transliteration":"fal-lahu","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) the best","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَـٰفِظًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"Guardian","transliteration":"ḥāfiẓan","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَرْحَمُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Most Merciful","transliteration":"arḥamu","verse_key":"12:64"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the merciful","transliteration":