 as their father had told them, it did not help them against the will of God, it merely satisfied a wish of Jacob’s. He knew well what We had taught him, though most people do not.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَخَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they entered","transliteration":"dakhalū","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَمَرَهُمْ","en_gloss":"ordered them","transliteration":"amarahum","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَبُوهُم","en_gloss":"their father","transliteration":"abūhum","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُغْنِى","en_gloss":"avail(ed)","transliteration":"yugh'nī","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَنْهُم","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":16,"ar":"حَاجَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(it was) a need","transliteration":"ḥājatan","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":18,"ar":"نَفْسِ","en_gloss":"Yaqub's soul","transliteration":"nafsi","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَعْقُوبَ","en_gloss":"Yaqub's soul","transliteration":"yaʿqūba","verse_key":"12:68"},{"pos":20,"ar":"قَضَىٰهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"which he carrie